{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q980120","formula":"C₁₈H₂₂ClNO₃","hill":"C18H22ClNO3","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":22.0,"N":1.0,"O":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"25C-NBOMe","ru":"2C-C-NBOMe"},"descriptions":{"en":"25C-NBOMe, also known as NBOMe-2C-C, 2C-C-NBOMe, or Cimbi-82, is a psychedelic drug and derivative of the psychedelic phenethylamine 2C-C. It acts as a potent agonist of the 5-HT2A receptor, and has been studied in its 11C radiolabelled form as a potential ligand for mapping the distribution of 5-HT2A receptors in the brain, using positron emission tomography (PET). Multiple deaths have occurred from usage of 25C-NBOMe due to the ease of accidental overdose. The long-term toxic effects of the drug have not been researched.","ru":"2C-C-NBOMe (NBOMe-2C-C, 25C-NBOMe) — психоактивное вещество, производное 2C-C (4-хлоро-2,5-диметокси-фенэтиламина)."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":46856354,"mass":335.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=CC=CC=C1CNCCC2=CC(=C(C=C2OC)Cl)OC","inchikey":"FJFPOGCVVLUYAQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-(4-chloro-2,5-dimethoxyphenyl)-N-[(2-methoxyphenyl)methyl]ethanamine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"46856354","atoms":45,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":6.564,"y":0.385,"z":0.647,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.919,"y":2.314,"z":0.02,"el":"O"},{"x":5.237,"y":-2.061,"z":-0.489,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.994,"y":1.655,"z":0.032,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.508,"y":-0.402,"z":-0.274,"el":"N"},{"x":0.806,"y":-0.099,"z":-1.049,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.125,"y":-0.259,"z":0.153,"el":"C"},{"x":2.246,"y":0.028,"z":-0.62,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.394,"y":-0.554,"z":0.881,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.826,"y":-0.693,"z":0.483,"el":"C"},{"x":2.733,"y":1.23,"z":-0.106,"el":"C"},{"x":3.094,"y":-1.072,"z":-0.745,"el":"C"},{"x":4.43,"y":-0.971,"z":-0.355,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.564,"y":0.418,"z